            <div xml:id="m-9945bf9b-5943-4811-97a1-d8e49131f042">
              <lg xml:id="m-4c86e5eb-d3df-4375-a601-e21ddc146597">
                <l xml:id="m-629d6476-a89e-49c4-aa4a-f63b8ef537ac" facs="#m-64311e30-6607-412f-825d-0e1ae4d4e8a7" label="ambiguous">810</l><l xml:id="m-eb0ef120-7144-4e41-9fee-6d83e59e2802" facs="#m-9d0df18b-703a-4808-b9d1-5202c92a9759" label="ambiguous">Ash Wednesday.</l><l xml:id="m-a97fecc3-52ca-4240-8a58-c03fbac501ac" facs="#m-871d5644-f704-438e-84ae-e2ca40ebc166" label="ambiguous">Ash Wednesday.</l><l xml:id="m-20a123f7-6def-4232-a993-7384ec0ecf54" facs="#m-20739d53-0668-4651-a746-fbf88202521d" label="text-like">The ashes, made from olive branches or other branches blessed the previous</l><l xml:id="m-ce351fc2-7d87-4d15-a953-12661d2d26c0" facs="#m-30ff39ff-4190-4194-8f31-76c85489d230" label="text-like">vear, are placed in a vessel on the altar.</l><l xml:id="m-93dffd9d-bfd5-4192-b90e-690a397f5788" facs="#m-d9141eb2-8bd0-4475-86d7-9d080fe3973e" label="text-like">AT TERCE.</l><l xml:id="m-3081daae-9155-4efe-96f4-72cd59388979" facs="#m-3bd610dc-5b4b-4031-931a-528038644847" label="ambiguous">Hymn.)</l><l xml:id="m-de99baa7-d721-4251-a478-4713a91170f5" facs="#m-b1f77e93-d4f7-44e1-b1d2-b8b782718914" label="ambiguous">8.</l><l xml:id="m-42651ff5-26a3-4226-9257-03fc91e8bc4a" facs="#m-d1e7f3f9-9992-4348-af92-de06041a8bb2" label="ambiguous">n</l><l xml:id="m-c7837ff0-a53c-48d7-9885-6f47c97beb5c" facs="#m-32994f53-8438-4872-9067-1abd2d2023fb" label="lyrics-like">Unc Sáncte nóbis Spíri-tus, Unum Pátri cum Fi¬</l><l xml:id="m-b46ab9c6-e091-4cd0-932a-db5a0ddbd595" facs="#m-d2b6ae98-0748-4d26-949c-5411d9c9acba" label="lyrics-like">li- Dignáre prómptus inge-ri Nóstro refúsus péctori.</l><l xml:id="m-40e610b5-9420-4808-8f68-647d131a1531" facs="#m-52bdd4c6-ceaf-413a-b4d5-ed3a0fb62ef2" label="lyrics-like">2. Os, língua, mens, sénsus, vígor, Confessi-ónem pérsonent,</l><l xml:id="m-e4e00a84-d640-42cf-b237-a09fd329f6e4" facs="#m-7b07ae86-e8a4-4f66-adba-fee146bb5d6c" label="lyrics-like">Flamméscat igne cá-ri-tas, Accéndat árdor próximos. 3. Praé¬</l><l xml:id="m-2ed24671-433f-4804-82a8-17120abce327" facs="#m-6a72694f-e916-4ade-a1a7-855731db4b45" label="lyrics-like">sta, Páter pi-issime, Patríque cómpar Unice, Cum Spí-ri¬</l><l xml:id="m-a337577a-a842-4f66-ade3-47386fbf0667" facs="#m-01f51539-1aba-4176-ab6a-6557b12ff408" label="lyrics-like">tu Parácli-to, Régnans per ómne saécu-lum. A-men.</l><l xml:id="m-e1ac1141-6e3d-433f-a9f4-cc7a2b7d6d0c" facs="#m-911ccb74-1335-48fb-bf8b-3fb9bc435d03" label="ambiguous">Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-2fbe49bc-fc46-44a7-90df-dd554f197938" facs="#m-0d5636b2-827d-4eab-895a-165a5918f813" label="ambiguous">8.6</l><l xml:id="m-00e4acc1-6f86-4445-9ede-a2c968f2a828" facs="#m-0aef34d8-a380-42d1-92f4-2e43bd82b628" label="ambiguous">D</l><l xml:id="m-c7209681-edbc-4908-83c9-a353a6072a12" facs="#m-7e03a4af-8696-4308-a473-498bc63313a6" label="lyrics-like">E-us ádjuvat me. Eu o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-801d02c0-17c0-49eb-887a-1457fbc7166d" facs="#m-f553f8c9-42d9-4921-bbe9-530c7ac5f3e9" label="lyrics-like">3. Quóniam aliéni insurrexérunt</l><l xml:id="m-74c23f50-9b94-4bd9-a538-22e51588dcea" facs="#m-6fe2798e-680d-4012-a74b-4bbcdee3ccbb" label="ambiguous">Psalm 53.</l><l xml:id="m-8969daf0-0e4a-47c7-9946-41868d6c38cf" facs="#m-5c98e07e-1d3f-41dd-bf09-06494d2559e5" label="lyrics-like">advérsum me, f et fórtes quaesié¬</l><l xml:id="m-b28b486f-70dd-4bc7-a0a7-db6fd0cef75c" facs="#m-e45325a8-7104-44c2-be24-787eff3225e5" label="lyrics-like">Eus. in nómine túo sálvum me</l><l xml:id="m-395576f6-2d4f-4bc6-b3e8-f2a0e899c4fd" facs="#m-15726263-1b97-4e22-b4b8-908db1d6fe57" label="lyrics-like">runt ánimam méam:“et non</l><l xml:id="m-054e1c89-bb0d-41e7-a03d-7864c95ac94d" facs="#m-10abbe37-ece1-4054-8a7c-d275a490e85b" label="lyrics-like">Dfac:"et in virtúte túa júdtea</l><l xml:id="m-e5fdd2dd-c81b-40f9-99ed-996ea356c231" facs="#m-632ab0f1-da35-46d9-a681-aac6bc17410c" label="lyrics-like">proposuérunt Déum ante conspé¬</l><l xml:id="m-57db9ff6-4122-4523-ad1e-9ec478b7f22f" facs="#m-b84b6a8f-0b84-43f4-8014-502b00d1975d" label="ambiguous">me.</l><l xml:id="m-b867f3dd-444e-45cf-a33e-22ea65e9012d" facs="#m-e377a3c3-83be-4899-9ad7-790b9a4d10b3" label="lyrics-like">ctum súum.</l><l xml:id="m-dd2439fb-f718-4aa8-a0d9-1c4e32eb69b2" facs="#m-ea3a8868-8b22-44e8-8555-048642aadfd3" label="lyrics-like">4. Ecce enim Déus ádjuvat me:</l><l xml:id="m-e4ac3846-bd25-4dba-8641-7361747aea6b" facs="#m-902a9b19-a392-49cd-8f4a-c97d0cd9606f" label="lyrics-like">2. Déus, exáudi oratiónem mé¬</l><l xml:id="m-f7a95a40-9804-4a91-87ce-5f6fbeb7e687" facs="#m-0832bc26-48c4-4c00-be10-3133ce5edfac" label="lyrics-like">áuribus pércipe vérba</l><l xml:id="m-50a1288c-b8fd-4f70-bef5-14243b016b30" facs="#m-a789747b-2546-403a-ac6a-82bd7affdd2d" label="ambiguous">am</l><l xml:id="m-a48a7587-a539-47b9-af5a-a9ee36e936fc" facs="#m-ffea0e12-10b3-4ab0-b7fa-f7d255a12c8b" label="lyrics-like">et Dóminus suscéptor est ánimae</l><l xml:id="m-8d52e379-0408-4bcc-875b-573a3b60daac" facs="#m-633c386f-a1da-40e7-9939-501e70456da9" label="lyrics-like">óris méi.</l><l xml:id="m-67618158-5a13-4b60-96c0-ce27ac1c4dd1" facs="#m-9720dabe-aedd-4bfb-90d9-f27ec52e94e7" label="lyrics-like">méae.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
